Error [jet.CellGuardEscapes]: A Cell guard cannot be stored inside `Held<CellReadGuard<Int>>`
  --> Tests/UI/LocalCellTiers/local_cell_guard_storage_boundary_reports_once_per_site_6.jet:9:13
    |
  9 |     consume(Held<CellReadGuard<Int>>{value: cell.guard_read()})
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A Cell guard is a temporary loan handle; storing it inside another value could keep the loan after its local scope ends
 Fix: Keep the guard in a local name or a tuple, and use `.map(...)` or `.split(...)` for projections
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0217
